Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|setup.wizard.enabled|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Setup Wizard|


Scenario: My SQ Lto My SQL
Priority: 4
	Given SetupWizard configure Default PG
	When Smoke view Welcome Page
	Then Smoke run Smoke
Scenario: My SQ Lto My SQL Edited Administrator User
Priority: 4
	Given SetupWizard view Default Portal Name PG
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|SetupWizardMySQL#MySQLtoMySQLEditAdministratorUser|
	And SetupWizard configure Sample Data PG
		|addSampleData|false|
	And SetupWizard configure Administrator User PG
		|administratorEmail|testsetupwizard@liferay.com|
		|administratorFirstName|TestSetupWizardFN|
		|administratorLastName|TestSetupWizardLN|
	And SetupWizard configure Database PG
		|databaseName|lportal|
		|databasePassword||
		|databaseType|MySQL|
		|databaseUserName||
		|jdbcDriverClassName||
		|jdbcURL||
	And SetupWizard finish Configuration PG
	And SetupWizard view Configuration Saved PG
	And Portlet shutdown Server
	And Portlet start Server
		|base_branch|${base_branch}|
		|deleteLiferayHome|false|
	And SetupWizard view Configured Database In Console
		|databaseType|${databaseType}|
##########################################################
The Poshi if element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	And User accept End User License Agreement
	And User reset Password
		|resetPassword|${resetPassword}|
		|setupWizardEnabled|${setupWizardEnabled}|
		|syntaxCheckingEnabled|${syntaxCheckingEnabled}|
	And User answer Password Reminder
	And AssertElementPresent at locator 'UserBar#USER_AVATAR_IMAGE'
	And User view Logged In PG
		|userFirstName|TestSetupWizardFN|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|Account Settings|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'testsetupwizard@liferay.com' at locator 'TextInput#EMAIL_ADDRESS'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'TestSetupWizardFN' at locator 'TextInput#FIRST_NAME'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'TestSetupWizardLN' at locator 'TextInput#LAST_NAME'
	Then AssertTextEquals the value 'testsetupwizard' at locator 'TextInput#SCREEN_NAME'
Scenario: My SQ Lto My SQL Lportal 1
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|databases.size|1|
	When these properties
		|portal.acceptance.tomcat.mysql|true|
	And these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|SetupWizardMySQL#MySQLtoMySQLLportal1|
	And SetupWizard configure PG
		|administratorEmail|test@liferay.com|
		|administratorFirstName|Test|
		|administratorLastName|Test|
		|databaseName|lportal1|
		|databasePassword||
		|databaseType|MySQL|
		|databaseUserName||
		|jdbcDriverClassName||
		|jdbcURL||
	And Smoke view Welcome Page
		|userFirstName|Joe|
		|userLastName|Bloggs|
	Then Smoke run Smoke
